          "summary": "Limit Section 4.9(a) inspections to an independent auditor, once per Calendar Year on 30 days' written notice at Array's cost, off-site where possible and with no direct systems access.",
          "comment": "[Playbook] Section 4.9(a) currently lets Array itself inspect our facilities without limit on merely \"reasonable\" notice and at our cost, so we have limited inspections to an independent auditor, one per Calendar Year on 30 days' prior written notice at Array's cost (unless an underpayment exceeding 5% is established), and added the confidentiality, off-site and no-systems-access protections.",
